        <mxCell id="troubleshooting" value="문제 해결 가이드" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="450" width="1000" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        
        <mxCell id="service-issues" value="서비스 연결 문제" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#D32F2F;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="490" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="service-issues-content" value="증상: 서비스를 통해 포드에 연결할 수 없음&#10;&#10;진단 명령:&#10;kubectl describe service &lt;service-name&gt;&#10;kubectl get endpoints &lt;service-name&gt;&#10;kubectl get pods -l &lt;selector-label&gt;&#10;&#10;일반적인 원인:&#10;• 잘못된 서비스 선택기&#10;• 포드가 준비되지 않음&#10;• 포트 불일치&#10;• 엔드포인트 누락" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;spacingTop=5;spacingLeft=10;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="520" width="260" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        
        <mxCell id="lb-issues" value="로드 밸런서 문제" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="490" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="lb-issues-content" value="증상: 외부에서 로드 밸런서에 연결할 수 없음&#10;&#10;진단 명령:&#10;kubectl get service &lt;service-name&gt; -o wide&#10;kubectl describe service &lt;service-name&gt;&#10;&#10;일반적인 원인:&#10;• 서브넷 태그 누락&#10;• 보안 그룹 규칙 문제&#10;• IAM 권한 부족&#10;• 상태 확인 실패" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;spacingTop=5;spacingLeft=10;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="520" width="260" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        
        <mxCell id="ingress-issues" value="Ingress 문제" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E8;strokeColor=#388E3C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="490" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="ingress-issues-content" value="증상: Ingress를 통한 접근이 작동하지 않음&#10;&#10;진단 명령:&#10;kubectl describe ingress &lt;ingress-name&gt;&#10;kubectl get ingress &lt;ingress-name&gt; -o yaml&#10;kubectl logs -n kube-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=aws-load-balancer-controller&#10;&#10;일반적인 원인:&#10;• 컨트롤러 설치 문제&#10;• 어노테이션 오류&#10;• 인증서 문제" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;spacingTop=5;spacingLeft=10;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="520" width="260" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        
        <mxCell id="solutions" value="일반적인 해결 방법" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#F57C00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="630" width="880" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="solutions-content" value="1. 서브넷 태그 확인 및 추가:&#10;   # 퍼블릭 서브넷: kubernetes.io/role/elb=1&#10;   # 프라이빗 서브넷: kubernetes.io/role/internal-elb=1&#10;   aws ec2 create-tags --resources subnet-12345678 --tags Key=kubernetes.io/role/elb,Value=1&#10;&#10;2. 보안 그룹 규칙 확인:&#10;   # 로드 밸런서 보안 그룹에서 필요한 포트 허용&#10;   aws ec2 authorize-security-group-ingress --group-id sg-12345678 --protocol tcp --port 80 --cidr 0.0.0.0/0&#10;&#10;3. 서비스 재생성:&#10;   kubectl delete service &lt;service-name&gt;&#10;   kubectl apply -f service.yaml&#10;&#10;4. AWS Load Balancer Controller 재시작:&#10;   kubectl rollout restart deployment aws-load-balancer-controller -n kube-system" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;spacingTop=5;spacingLeft=10;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="660" width="840" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>